    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for an intense aerial military campaign in Strike Mission, a top-down action game where you take control of elite pilot Jake Walker on a critical mission to save the world from a global tech threat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With immersive gameplay, a tactical radar system, multiple mission objectives, and cinematic cutscenes, Strike Mission blends fast-paced action with strategy and storytelling.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock achievements and prove you're the hero the world needs.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Invade enemy territories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/6fb71d826285bc67f7151b463f3abb5b.poster.avif?t=1752842476\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/6fb71d826285bc67f7151b463f3abb5b.webm?t=1752842476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/6fb71d826285bc67f7151b463f3abb5b.mp4?t=1752842476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Destroy enemy structures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/987b0085760bec420bec4563414b924b.poster.avif?t=1752842476\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/987b0085760bec420bec4563414b924b.webm?t=1752842476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/987b0085760bec420bec4563414b924b.mp4?t=1752842476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle against warships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/2cbd78bea65be22480e0c820dd083b90.poster.avif?t=1752842476\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/2cbd78bea65be22480e0c820dd083b90.webm?t=1752842476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/2cbd78bea65be22480e0c820dd083b90.mp4?t=1752842476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rescue hostages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/709a8346878976c6bb16562ad70d9fbd.poster.avif?t=1752842476\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/709a8346878976c6bb16562ad70d9fbd.webm?t=1752842476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/709a8346878976c6bb16562ad70d9fbd.mp4?t=1752842476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for an intense aerial military campaign in Strike Mission, a top-down action game where you take control of elite pilot Jake Walker on a critical mission to save the world from a global tech threat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With immersive gameplay, a tactical radar system, multiple mission objectives, and cinematic cutscenes, Strike Mission blends fast-paced action with strategy and storytelling.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock achievements and prove you're the hero the world needs.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Invade enemy territories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/6fb71d826285bc67f7151b463f3abb5b.poster.avif?t=1752842476\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/6fb71d826285bc67f7151b463f3abb5b.webm?t=1752842476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/6fb71d826285bc67f7151b463f3abb5b.mp4?t=1752842476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Destroy enemy structures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/987b0085760bec420bec4563414b924b.poster.avif?t=1752842476\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/987b0085760bec420bec4563414b924b.webm?t=1752842476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118880/extras/987b0085760bec420bec4563414b924b.mp4?t=175